      "url": "https://offers.dailymail.com/info/365662/choose-from-one-of-these-options",
      "title": "Daily Mail Essential subscription - Daily Mail",
      "text": "Choose from one of these options\n\nView Daily Mail with personalised ads\n\n\n  \n\nClick ‘Go Back to Accept’ if you do not want to purchase a Daily Mail Essential subscription\n\n\nGo Back to Accept\nTo view the Daily Mail without paying for a Daily Mail Essential subscription you will need to consent to personalised advertising cookies and similar technologies.\n\nDaily Mail Essential\n\n\n  \n\nView the Daily Mail without personalised advertising and with reduced tracking\n\n£2.70 per month\n\nSubscribe\nDaily Mail account required to subscribe. Rolling monthly renewal, cancel any time. We may still use cookies and similar technologies to provide our service and for other purposes, including personalised content, measurement, audience research and services development.\nFind out more about Daily Mail Essential below\nWhat is Daily Mail Essential?\n\nDaily Mail Essential allows you to have reduced tracking and a personalised ads-free experience on the Daily Mail. Daily Mail Essential is a separate subscription from DailyMail+ and DailyMail+ Editions. Find out more about the differences between these subscriptions below.\n\n\nReduced tracking\n\nWe will not use any cookies or other similar technologies to personalise ads that Daily Mail Essential subscribers see on the Daily Mail. We may still use cookies and similar technologies to provide our service and for other purposes, including personalised content, measurement, audience research and services development.  \n\nNo personalised advertising\n\nWith Daily Mail Essential you will not see any personalised ads. We may still show you non-personalised ads.  \n\nIf you no longer want Daily Mail Essential\n\nThe subscription will auto-renew each month until cancelled. Cancel anytime before each renewal date. If you do choose to cancel, you will need to consent to personalised advertising to continue viewing the Daily Mail.\n\n\nGot any questions?\nDoes a DailyMail+ or DailyMail+ Editions subscription include the features of Daily Mail Essential?\n\nA DailyMail+ or DailyMail+ Editions subscription does not include the features of Mail Essential. They are separate subscriptions; if you want the benefits of Daily Mail Essential with your Daily Mail+ and/or Daily Mail+Editions subscription, you will need to purchase a Daily Mail Essential subscription in addition to your DailyMail+ and/or DailyMail+ Editions subscription both, you'll need to subscribe to both. Without a Daily Mail Essential subscription, DailyMail+ and DailyMail+ Editions subscribers will need to consent to personalised advertising cookies and other similar technologies to view their respective Daily Mail subscriptions may still see ads.\n\n\nWhat is included in my Daily Mail Essential subscription?\n\nDaily Mail Essential is a subscription that allows you to view Daily Mail content without personalised advertising and with reduced tracking. If you subscribe to Daily Mail Essential, we may still show you ads when you use the Daily Mail, but we will not use personalised advertising cookies or similar technologies to show them to you. We may still use cookies and similar technologies to provide our service and for other purposes, including personalised content, measurement, audience research and service development. Click Privacy Settings to learn more. Privacy Settings can be accessed via our Privacy Policy.\"  \n\nHow can I cancel my Daily Mail Essential subscription?\n\nYou may cancel your subscription at any time by logging in to the Daily Mail and visiting the 'Manage Subscription' tab in your profile area. If you cancel your subscription before your next payment date, no further payments will be taken. However, please note that refunds are not available for the remainder of your current subscription period. For more information, please visit our FAQs.\n\n\nHow do I access my subscription across devices?\n\nEach time you access the Daily Mail from a new device, a pop up will appear prompting you to choose how you wish to view the Daily Mail. You can access your Daily Mail Essential subscription on any device by logging in to your Daily Mail account when you see the 'Already a Daily Mail Essential subscriber?' link in the pop up.  \n\nIf I cancel my Daily Mail Essential subscription, will my viewing experience on the Daily Mail change?\n\nIf you cancel your Daily Mail Essential subscription, a pop up will appear next time you access the Daily Mail prompting you to choose how you wish to view the Daily Mail.  If you do not wish to resubscribe to Daily Mail Essential, you will need to consent to personalised advertising to continue viewing the Daily Mail.  \n\n\nHelp & FAQs Privacy & Cookies Policy Website Terms & Conditions Purchase Terms & Conditions\n\nAssociated Newspapers Limited is a company registered in England and Wales (Company No. 084121), Northcliffe House, 9 Derry Street, Kensington, London, W8 5HY. VAT Number: GB 243 5711 74",
